flowchart LR
    drafting["drafting<br/>writer<br/>START"]
    review["review<br/>reviewer"]
    human_review["human_review<br/>reviewer<br/>WAITING FOR HUMAN"]
    correction["correction<br/>writer"]
    release["release<br/>release-coordinator"]
    diagnosis["diagnosis<br/>reviewer"]
    complete["complete<br/>release-coordinator<br/>COMPLETE"]
    drafting -->|review_ready| review
    review -->|accepted: review passes policy| release
    review -->|changes_required| correction
    review -->|human_action_required: listen or acceptance pending| human_review
    human_review -->|listen_pending: wait for confirmation| human_review
    human_review -->|human_listened: review passed| release
    human_review -->|human_accepted| release
    human_review -->|human_rejected| correction
    correction -->|review_ready: article or draft evidence changed| review
    release -->|released: schedule or handoff verified| complete
    release -->|review_required: missing release evidence| diagnosis
    diagnosis -->|review_ready: prepared packet| review
    diagnosis -->|changes_required: Writer preparation| correction
    diagnosis -->|proven: new release-gate proof| release
    classDef start fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb,color:#1e3a8a
    classDef waiting fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,color:#78350f
    classDef done fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d
    class drafting start
    class human_review waiting
    class complete done
